     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">A little more poking around shows that this is already known: <div><br></div><div>  dynamic plots don&#39;t work with by_group:  <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404133609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35f0AMtroWyF61jYICLdbz\">https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71</a></div><div><br></div><div>Sorry for distraction and thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Ian</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Thursday, April 3, 2014 11:10:22 AM UTC-5, Ian Lyttle wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>First: congrats on 0.9! This shiny/ggvis/knitr ecosystem is really turning into something amazing!</div><div><br></div><div>Second: I might be trying to use ggvis and shiny in a way that &quot;hasn&#39;t been built yet&quot;. </div><div><br></div><div>If that&#39;s the case, a perfectly acceptable answer will be, &quot;Not yet, wait until we have built it&quot;.</div><div><br></div><div>Here are the nuggets of what I am trying to do - the full shiny app is at <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/9954598/99dbf4ae1084f9cc3468cd299216ccb3f223dba0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/9954598/99dbf4ae1084f9cc3468cd299216ccb3f223dba0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404133609000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eVOwVhH5ZzHzKztqpLkQA\">https://gist.github.com/ijlyttle/9954598/99dbf4ae1084f9cc3468cd299216ccb3f223dba0</a> :</div><div><br></div><div>This works interactively and in shiny:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"width:744px\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">    ggvis<span>(</span>diamonds<span>,</span> props<span>(</span>x <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">~</span>table<span>))</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">+</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">      layer_histogram<span>(</span>binwidth <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999